{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<h2>日本爆紅「咖啡＋綠茶」減脂法</h2>\n<p>Threads 近期瘋傳「咖啡＋綠茶」減脂法，由日本減重門診醫師工藤孝文提出，這套方法的核心是將無糖黑咖啡與無糖綠茶以 1:1 比例混合，在每日三餐飯前約 15 至 30 分鐘飲用一杯約 250 至 300 毫升，每天共 3 杯。 咖啡千萬不能加糖或奶，因為奶會影響綠原酸吸收，若不喜歡咖啡苦澀味，可將綠茶加進咖啡沖淡。\n</p>\n<p>//去水腫兼幫助排便/<br/>\n當中綠茶的兒茶素能減緩脂質吸收並促進脂肪組織能量代謝；咖啡因能活化交感神經，短時間提升基礎代謝率、加速脂肪分解；咖啡的綠原酸則能調節腸道微生態並延緩葡萄糖吸收。工藤醫師強調，這套方法主打「將健康融入既有生活習慣」，不硬性減少食量，先從改善飲品習慣開始，並建議每天清晨空腹量體重以掌握長期體態趨勢。</p>\n<h2>幾類人士不適宜飲用</h2>\n<p>不過，綠茶與咖啡咖啡因含量都高，成年人每日攝取不宜超過 400 毫克（100ml 中咖啡和綠茶分別約 60mg 和 20mg）。 若本身對咖啡因較敏感，平時喝咖啡已容易出現心跳加速、手震、焦慮、腸胃不適或失眠等情況，再將咖啡與濃茶疊加飲用，不適反應可能更明顯。</p>\n<p>另外，患有肝臟疾病或肝功能異常的人，應避免自行服用高濃度綠茶萃取補充品，以免增加肝臟負擔。 糖尿病患者、血糖控制不穩定者，或正長期服用藥物的人，也不應把這種飲法視為治療或控制病情的方法；若想大量飲用，最好先諮詢醫生或營養師。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179308804740398996_17828853266ae05a2fbbdce.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179308804740398996_17828853266ae05a2fbbdce.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：AI生成圖)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179308804949022150_17708905666ae05a31bc2fa.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179308804949022150_17708905666ae05a31bc2fa.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：AI生成圖)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179308805131429308_14362862766ae05a33ac2de.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179308805131429308_14362862766ae05a33ac2de.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：AI生成圖)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179308805388918508_16386700246ae05a3685589.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179308805388918508_16386700246ae05a3685589.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：AI生成圖)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179308805671213485_20461747326ae05a3933daf.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179308805671213485_20461747326ae05a3933daf.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：AI生成圖)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/De_N6lKE9JN/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T08:22:33.722863+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":714,"images":5,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T08:00:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T08:38:42.530384+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T08:19:09.398282+00:00","content_hash":"7e05962cdbd969a5446c59a8fe4aad1e0587f42bf806ddb5c29ea23ce68e472d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}